WEBVTT

NOTE Animated terminal (1280x720, dark slate) showing the DBML CLI
workflow. Cues are timed to the line animations in demo.svg.

00:00.900 --> 00:01.700
Command: dbml sql schema.dbml -o schema.sql

00:01.700 --> 00:02.400
Output: Generated initial_schema.sql

00:02.400 --> 00:03.100
Command: dbml mermaid schema.dbml -o diagram.mmd

00:03.100 --> 00:03.800
Output: Generated database-erd.mmd

00:03.800 --> 00:04.500
Command: dbml svg schema.dbml -o diagram.svg

00:04.500 --> 00:05.200
Output: Generated schema.svg

00:05.200 --> 00:05.900
Command: dbml all schema.dbml --output-dir ./output

00:05.900 --> 00:06.600
Output: Generated SQL, Mermaid, and SVG

00:06.600 --> 00:07.300
Command: dbml serve --port 8080

00:07.300 --> 00:08.000
Output: HTTP server listening on http://localhost:8080

00:08.000 --> 00:08.700
Output: Ctrl+C to stop

00:08.700 --> 00:15.000
Blank prompt